			"notes": "## [v26.3.1-mc26.3.x] - 2026-09-25\n\n### Added\n\n- Add data-driven bone meal behavior, allowing all interactions to be customized through the\n  `universalbonemeal:bonemealables` block data map and the `bone_meal_behavior` and `block_predicate` registries, see\n  the [README](https://github.com/Fuzss/universal-bone-meal/blob/26.3.x/README.md) documentation for details\n- Add `#universalbonemeal:fertilizer_resistant_plants` block tag for making any block immune to bone meal\n\n### Removed\n\n- Remove the old server config file in favor of data packs"
